 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He passed by and saw a man",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blind from his earliest days",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The disciples stood and asked",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who sinned to cause such pain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Neither this man nor his parents",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Did sin to bring this state",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It happened so the works of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Might be revealed in his fate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We must do the works of him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who sent me while it is day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Night is coming when no one",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Can work in the fading light",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As long as I am in the world",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the light of the world",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spat on the ground and made",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mud with his saliva poured",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We must do the works of him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who sent me while it is day",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Night is coming when no one",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Can work in the fading light",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spread it on the man's eyes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And told him to go and wash",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the pool of Siloam",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Which means the one who was sent",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the man went and washed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And came back seeing the light",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Work while it is day",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the night arrives",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
